    (0, None, '\'Chef flatly refuses to cook this dish.\' "Naotrez", "flatly", is built on "otrezat\'", to cut off, as if the answer were cut short. "Otkazyvayetsya", "refuses", ends in "-sya", the little "self" many Russian verbs carry.'),
